rat',att,'se',sqrt(vv),'CI',att+c(-1,1)*qnorm(.975)*sqrt(vv),'\\\\n')\n}\nRS\"","aggregated_output":"\n Demographics trim FALSE n 185 15992 NN -3600.701 se Inf G 1 CI NaN NaN maxreuse 185 \n s 1 nt 37 nc 15274 diff -6878.711 \n s 2 nt 40 nc 355 diff -2726.812 \n s 3 nt 34 nc 227 diff -5006.281 \n s 4 nt 37 nc 24 diff -5692.86 \n s 5 nt 37 nc 112 diff -689.3462 \nstrat -4161.838 se 678.0773 CI -5490.845 -2832.831 \n\n Demographics trim TRUE n 185 12706 NN -3774.705 se Inf G 1 CI NaN NaN maxreuse 185 \n s 1 nt 37 nc 12017 diff -6313.837 \n s 2 nt 40 nc 345 diff -2519.215 \n s 3 nt 34 nc 231 diff -5195.991 \n s 4 nt 37 nc 23 diff -4580.921 \n s 5 nt 37 nc 90 diff -650.7896 \nstrat -3808.744 se 685.8964 CI -5153.076 -2464.411 \n\n Demographics + earnings trim FALSE n 185 15992 NN 1442.708 se Inf G 1 CI NaN NaN maxreuse 185 \n s 1 nt 37 nc 15613 diff -6548.34 \n s 2 nt 37 nc 219 diff 656.8666 \n s 3 nt 37 nc 47 diff 3765.197 \n s 4 nt 37 nc 82 diff 1178.056 \n s 5 nt 37 nc 31 diff 230.3763 \nstrat -143.5688 se 644.1208 CI -1406.022 1118.885 \n\n Demographics + earnings trim TRUE n 185 5776 NN 1818.594 se Inf G 1 CI NaN NaN maxreuse 185 \n s 1 nt 37 nc 5400 diff 498.1425 \n s 2 nt 37 nc 217 diff 755.622 \n s 3 nt 37 nc 47 diff 3546.179 \n s 4 nt 37 nc 82 diff 1178.056 \n s 5 nt 37 nc 30 diff 349.7051 \nstrat 1265.541 se 645.8113 CI -0.2260445 2531.308 \nWarning messages:\n1: In qt(0.975, G - 1) : NaNs produced\n2: In qt(0.975, G - 1) : NaNs produced\n3: In qt(0.975, G - 1) : NaNs produced\n4: In qt(0.975, G - 1) : NaNs produced\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
